        <mxCell id="transactions_note" value="fx_rate_id is the rate applied when the transaction settled &#8212; a historical fact,&#10;not derivable from the current rate. Storing the rate id is normalized;&#10;storing amount &#215; rate would not be.&#10;indexes: (customer_id, created_at DESC), (created_at DESC), (currency_code), (fx_rate_id)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
